{"unit_id":"Liyu147__dsh-enter-guard#card-card-zh","repo":"Liyu147/dsh-enter-guard","commit":"8b95578dd89504b98cf738756f24fc3bece6d5e7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-guard（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 网页输入框增加回车二次确认，减少草稿未完成时误发送。它在浏览器端监听输入区键盘和编辑事件，第一次普通 Enter 会拦截发送并显示提示，再按 Enter 才交由 DSH 发送。输入其他按键、编辑草稿、失焦或点击输入区外会取消待确认状态；空草稿、命令或文件候选菜单以及组合键会保留原有处理。适合经常在网页端输入长消息的用户；无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:140-163","lib/client.js:252-263"]}
{"unit_id":"Liyu147__dsh-enter-guard#card-card-en","repo":"Liyu147/dsh-enter-guard","commit":"8b95578dd89504b98cf738756f24fc3bece6d5e7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-enter-guard adds second-Enter confirmation to the DSH web composer. The first plain Enter is blocked with a hint; pressing Enter again sends. Other keys or leaving the composer cancel confirmation. Empty drafts and menus keep native handling. It helps avoid sending unfinished messages.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:140-163","lib/client.js:252-263"]}
