{"unit_id":"Liyu147__dsh-enter-guard#feature-feature-1","repo":"Liyu147/dsh-enter-guard","commit":"8b95578dd89504b98cf738756f24fc3bece6d5e7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-guard 的功能「双回车确认」：第一次无修饰键的 Enter 会阻止默认发送并显示提示；待确认时再次按 Enter 即放行给 DSH。 由网页输入区的键盘事件处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:135-163"]}
{"unit_id":"Liyu147__dsh-enter-guard#feature-feature-2","repo":"Liyu147/dsh-enter-guard","commit":"8b95578dd89504b98cf738756f24fc3bece6d5e7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-guard 的功能「键入或离开时取消」：确认待定期间输入其他按键、编辑内容、开始输入法组字、移出焦点或点击输入区外，都会取消确认状态。 由网页输入区的键盘事件处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:265-282"]}
{"unit_id":"Liyu147__dsh-enter-guard#feature-feature-3","repo":"Liyu147/dsh-enter-guard","commit":"8b95578dd89504b98cf738756f24fc3bece6d5e7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-guard 的功能「保留菜单和快捷发送」：命令或文件候选菜单打开、空草稿、Enter 长按重复以及 Ctrl/Cmd/Shift 等修饰键均不触发首次拦截。 由网页输入区的键盘事件处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:130-152"]}
{"unit_id":"Liyu147__dsh-enter-guard#caveat-caveat-1","repo":"Liyu147/dsh-enter-guard","commit":"8b95578dd89504b98cf738756f24fc3bece6d5e7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enter-guard 使用 DSH 网页 composer 的 DOM 选择器；代码在找不到输入框时不拦截按键，因此依赖这些界面锚点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:34-37","lib/client.js:90-104","lib/client.js:383-392"]}
